ty & Staff Current Students Trinity Students New Students (Fall 2026) Breadcrumb Home Admissions Home Making a tuition deposit How to submit your tuition deposit If you’re ready to choose Augustana, there are two ways to submit your $350 non-refundable tuition deposit: Pay online. Pay by credit card by logging into your applicant status page . Pay by mail. Make the check or money order out to Augustana College and note your student’s name and birth date. Checks can be sent to: Augustana College Admissions, 639 38th St., Rock Island, Ill., 61201. Note: International students also can make a payment using Flywire . See Student Accounts for more information about Flywire payments. Deadlines Your tuition deposit deadline depends on your application deadline . Early Decision applicants: Deposits are due Dec. 20. Early Action applicants: Deposits are due May 1. Regular Decision applicants: Fall enrollment: Deposits are due May 1. Spring enrollment: Deposits are due Dec. 1. Graduate students in the master of speech-language pathology program: Deposits are due April 15. Visit Apply Get info Augustana College 639 38th Street Rock Island, Ill., 61201 (map) 800-798-8100 309-794-7000 © 2026 Augustana College. All rights reserved. Social Media Facebook Facebook Icon Circle with Facebook's F Instagram Instagram Round icon with Instagram Logo TikTok TikTok Round Icon with TikTok logo LinkedIn LinkedIn Round Icon with LinkedIn logo Twitter Twitter X Round Icon with Twitter X logo Youtube YouTube Round icon with YouTube logo Quick Links Contact Academic calendar Blogustana Bookstore Complaint policy Disability & Access Resources Employment Graduate program Housing insecurity resources Library Magazine Maps and directions Non-discrimination Privacy Sitemap Title IX Locations and Facilities Building directory Augustana Convenient Care Augustana Center for Visual Culture Brunner Theatre Center Fryxell Geology Museum John Deere Planetarium Roseman Center for Speech, Language, and Hearin